11pt;\">「</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">HuStar </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">대경혁신인재양성 프로젝트 의료산업혁신아카데미</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">」</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">를 운영하고 있습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">. </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 15.6pt; text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -15.6pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-layout-grid-mode: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 15.8pt; text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -15.8pt; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-layout-grid-mode: none;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">동 사업의 교육생을 모집하고자 하오니</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">관심있는 분들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 15.8pt; text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -15.8pt; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-layout-grid-mode: none;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 33.4pt; text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -33.4pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-layout-grid-mode: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 33.4pt; text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -33.4pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-layout-grid-mode: none;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">신청자격</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 33.4pt; text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -33.4pt; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-layout-grid-mode: none;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">대학</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">학사 이상</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">) </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">졸업자 및 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">2021</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">년 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">8</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">월 졸업예정자(만 33세 이하, 1988.1.1. 이후 출생자)</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 33.4pt; text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -33.4pt; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-layout-grid-mode: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">2021</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">년 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">8</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">월 졸업예정자의 경우 잔여학점이 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">6학점을 초과할</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\"> 경우 신청 불가</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 33.4pt; text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -33.4pt; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-layout-grid-mode: none;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 미취업자 대상</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">직장 건강보험 및 국민연금 가입 여부 기준</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 33.4pt; text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -33.4pt; letter-spacing: -1.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-layout-grid-mode: none;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">) </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">접수마감일 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">기준 주민등록 상 주소지가 대구</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">·</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1.4pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">경북인 자 또는&nbsp;대구</span><span s