><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">생명공학</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">제약학과 등 이공계 관련 학과 전공자</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 15.7pt; text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -15.7pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-layout-grid-mode: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 15.7pt; text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -15.7pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-layout-grid-mode: none;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">신청 기간 및 방법</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 15.7pt; text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -15.7pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-layout-grid-mode: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">신청기간 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">: 2021. 1. 4.(월</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">) ~ 2021. 1. 18.(월</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 15.7pt; text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5; text-indent: -15.7pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-layout-grid-mode: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nb